Package: com.cysxl.atria
Name: Atria
Version: 1.9.1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
Conflicts: me.lau.atria, com.irepo.boxy4, me.kritanta.homepluspro
Replaces: me.lau.atria
Provides: me.lau.atria
Description: A fork of ren7995's Atria.
 Edits your homescreen layout on iOS 16-17, page by page.
 * set rows, columns, icon size & spacing.
 * move icon labels & page dots.
 * set the dock's rows, columns & background alpha.
 * add page labels & a welcome message.
 * blur & tint a background behind your icons.
 * put App Library & recents in the floating dock.
 * hide page dots, badges, labels & the dock.
 * export & import your settings.
 * support roothide.
Author: ren7995, CySxL
Maintainer: CySxL
Icon: https://cysxl.github.io/icons/com.cysxl.atria.png
Section: Tweaks